    "detailed_description": "<strong>Experience the highs and lows that come with endlessly trying to cross The Gap</strong><br>Mind-bending Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Perceive The Gap<br></li><li> Gaze at The Gap<br></li><li> Walk around <br></li><li> Watch the other side talk without you<br></li><li> Be transformed by The Gap<br></li><li> Blame The  Gap for all your misfortunes<br></li><li> Wave<br></li><li> Bathe in the misery of The Gap<br></li><li> Thoroughly enjoy the frustration that comes with feeling stuck on either side of The Gap<br></li><li> Become contempt with the concept of Gap<br></li><li> Shout <br></li><li> Constantly question your place within The Gap<br></li><li> Do a Flip!<br></li><li> Try to find a way out of The Gap</li></ul>",
